{"text": "She lit a third match. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now she was sitting under a beautiful Christmas tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was bigger and prettier than the tree at the rich merchants house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Thousands of candles were shining on its green branches. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The little girl reached up her hands toward the lights. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the match went out, but the candles went higher and higher. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon they looked like the bright stars in the sky. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One of the stars fell down with a long tail of fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Someone is going up to heaven now, said the little girl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her grandmother had told her this a long time ago. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Grandmother was the only person who had ever loved her, but she was gone now.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "h", "e", " ", "l", "i", "t", " ", "a", " ", "t", "h", "i", "r", "d", " ", "m", "a", "t", "c", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "o", "w", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "u", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "a", " ", "b", "e", "a", "u", "t", "i", "f", "u", "l", " ", "C", "h", "r", "i", "s", "t", "m", "a", "s", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "b", "i", "g", "g", "e", "r", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "p", "r", "e", "t", "t", "i", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "a", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "i", "c", "h", " ", "m", "e", "r", "c", "h", "a", "n", "t", "s", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n"